@startuml
!include styles/restrained.iuml
title 参与者扩展 · 独立权限校验
caption 虚构场景；增加权限服务并就近排列；容量约束仍由预约存储原子执行
actor "预约用户" as User
participant "预约入口" as API
participant "预约服务" as Booking
participant "权限服务" as Auth
database "预约存储" as DB

== 受理与权限 ==
User -> API : 提交预约
activate API
API -> Booking : 创建预约
activate Booking
Booking -> Auth : 检查预约权限
activate Auth
Auth --> Booking : 允许或拒绝
deactivate Auth
alt 允许预约
  == 原子提交 ==
  Booking -> DB : 按容量约束创建预约
  activate DB
  DB --> Booking : 创建成功或容量不足
  deactivate DB
  alt 创建成功
    Booking --> API : 预约编号
  else 容量不足
    Booking --> API : 容量冲突
  end
else 拒绝预约
  Booking --> API : 无权限
end
deactivate Booking
API --> User : 预约结果
deactivate API
@enduml
